<title>USA: Talbots sees higher '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Talbots sees higher '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>HINGHAM, Mass. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talbots Inc said on Thursday that holiday sales trends were in line with the fall season and that it continues to expect increased profits in fiscal year 1996.</p>
<p>The company reported on Thursday that December same-store sales fell 1.8 percent and year-to-date same-store sales fell 3.9 percent.  The company said total sales increased eight percent for the month of December and four percent for the year to date.</p>
</text>
